---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Honest Picture is educational and informational only. It is not medical, psychological, financial, or legal advice."
  path="/disclaimer"
  eyebrow="Trust & Legal"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  lede="Educational and informational only. Please read this before relying on anything here."
  updated="June 2026"
  showDisclaimer={false}
>
  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} presents publicly available research, government data, and
    peer-reviewed studies to help people understand their lives in honest context.
    It is <strong>not medical, psychological, financial, or legal advice</strong>,
    and it is not a diagnostic tool. The assessment and every page are for general
    educational and informational purposes only.
  </p>

  <h2>If you are struggling</h2>
  <p>
    If you are experiencing a mental health crisis, or thoughts of harming
    yourself, please contact a qualified professional or a crisis service right
    away. In the United States, call or text <strong>988</strong> for the Suicide
    and Crisis Lifeline, available 24/7. Outside the U.S., please search for your
    local crisis line or emergency number. This website cannot and does not provide
    crisis support.
  </p>

  <h2>About the data</h2>
  <p>
    We cite real sources and aim for accuracy, but:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Figures are often <strong>rounded and approximate</strong>, and are presented to show the shape of a distribution, not to measure your individual life precisely.</li>
    <li>Most population data is strongest for the United States and other high-income countries, and may not represent your situation.</li>
    <li>Research evolves, and findings can be <strong>mixed or contested</strong>; where that is the case, we try to say so.</li>
    <li>Statistics describe groups, not individuals. Being "typical" or "atypical" on any measure says nothing about your worth or your future.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The assessment</h2>
  <p>
    The Context Assessment does not score, grade, or evaluate you. It places your
    answers next to population data and research. Its output is context, not a
    verdict, a diagnosis, or a recommendation. Decisions about your money, health,
    work, or relationships should be made with appropriate professional guidance,
    not on the basis of this tool.
  </p>

  <h2>No outcomes are promised</h2>
  <p>
    We make no claim that using this site will improve your life, change your
    circumstances, or produce any particular result. Seeing your situation clearly
    is valuable, but it is not a treatment and not a guarantee.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
